    "transcribed": "2026-07-27",
    "rechecked": "2026-08-30: re-read against the November 3 2026 directory. All 59 precincts and every street address match. Precinct 51 is still consolidated with 45 while Ken-O-Sha is closed. One transcription error found and fixed here (precinct 11, Harrion -> Harrison).",
    "licence": "Public record of the City of Grand Rapids, redistributed as published.",
    "how_to_update": "Each election the clerk publishes a new precinct directory PDF at source_page, under a new file name. Read it and update the rows below. Check the count is still 59 and that numbering runs 1-59.",
    "notes": [
      "Addresses are stored as street and ZIP, without the city: every address here is in Grand Rapids, and nothing parses the string, since map links are built from lat and lng.",
      "The directory is not carefully proofed and the November edition repeats every error the August one had: Madison as Madion, Kalamazoo as Kalamzoo, Garfield as Gafield, Orthodox as Othodox, and LaGrave as one word. Those are corrected here, so do not copy the PDF's spellings back in.",
      "Two names here are deliberately fuller than the PDF prints them, and are not errors to reconcile: precinct 47 is Martin Luther King Jr. Leadership Academy, and precinct 54 is East Congregational United Church of Christ.",
      "consolidated_with means that precinct votes at another precinct's location for this election only. Check the PDF footnotes each time.",
      "Precinct 9 is where the city directory and the Kent County listing disagree. The city is correct, confirmed with the clerk's office on 2026-07-27."
    ],
    "caution": "Polling places change every election. If source_document names an election that has passed, this file is out of date.",
    "verified_with_clerk": "2026-07-27: the Grand Rapids City Clerk's office confirmed by phone that the city directory is correct where it differs from the Kent County listing (precinct 9), and that precinct 51 votes at precinct 45's location while Ken-O-Sha School is closed.",
    "source_pdf_caution": "The city serves PDFs under generated paths. This URL has already changed once; if it 404s, find the current directory at source_page."
  },
